      "unit_id": "OLP-0510",
      "source_correction_id": "OLINT-011",
      "finding": "يوازې د اټومي ارزښتونو له مخې د نړۍو يو شان کول د شرط صدق نۀ ساتي. W={a,b,c}; R reflexive plus aRc; p true only at c, q nowhere. a and b have the same atomic P-profile, but p→q is false at a and true at b. The quotient identifies a,b and makes p→q false at their shared class.",
